<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Our common stock began trading on the NASDAQ Global Select Market on April 15, 2015 under the symbol &#8220;XBIT.&#8221; Prior to that time, there was no established public trading market for our common stock.</p>

