<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>6. Common Stock </b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">Pursuant to its Articles, the Company has an unlimited number of shares available for issuance with <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c440">no</span> par value.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c441">No</span> shares of common stock were issued during the year ended December 31, 2025.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">During the year ended December 31, 2024, <ix:nonFraction id="c442" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="Share" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">50,767</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock were issued upon the exercise of stock options, at prices ranging from $<ix:nonFraction id="c443" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_RangeAxis-MinimumMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">3.38</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction id="c444" contextRef="i_2024-12-31_RangeAxis-MaximumMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">5.62</ix:nonFraction> per share, for total proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction id="c445" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromStockOptionsExercised" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">200</ix:nonFraction> thousand.</p>
</ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

